# TODO -- timing constraints still missing
#
# The generated-clock / clock-group lines for the DDR3 IP are NOT in this file
# yet. They need the on-chip instance path, which is now known:
#
#     DDR3 IP instance : u_DDR3_50H      (same name osd uses)
#     PLL IP instance  : u_pll
#
# osd/constr/osd_ddr3_timing.fdc can therefore be adapted by instantiating
# those names, but it must NOT be copied verbatim: it also constrains
# cmos1_pclk / cmos2_pclk / cmos1_8_16bit / cmos2_8_16bit, which do not exist
# in this design. A create_generated_clock whose object matches nothing ABORTS
# the flow -- that file says so in its own header.
#
# Before adding these lines, first synthesise as-is and read the clock report
# to see whether PDS already infers ddrphy_clkin / ioclk* from the DDR3 IP
# configuration. If it does, adding explicit create_generated_clock lines
